fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nRemoves dead code I noticed while working on something else.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nProvide additional information and explanation of your PR, including areas that you are uncertain of or require special attention from reviewers. For examples, please read our pull request guidelines: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/contribution_rules.html#explain-your-contributions\r\n-->\r\nNo behavior change expected.\r\n\r\n`parse_tag_assign_eof` clears the `r_assign` argument at the start, so there is no reason to assign `Variant()` to it before the call.  The `assign` variable is not used between assigning `Variant()` and calling the function so it's safe to remove.\r\n\r\nThe `r_assign = \"\"` line was added in 2016  in 5bf25e46be and just a day later `assign = Variant()` was used in 4e367a4b7b\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/46173009dc4ab6e582cf978e2d68b0ddfeb1e934/core/variant/variant_parser.cpp#L1769-L1771 \r\nI think the code was just copied around afterwards and this was missed.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/